# 2psim.mtb

noecho
note This macro will simulate randomization of
note "successes" and "failures" related to comparing
note two population proportions.
note
note The user is to specify the sample sizes, the
note numbers of "yes" responses for the two groups,
note and the number of repetitions of the simulation.
note
note The program takes the total numbers of "successes"
note and "failures" and distributes them randomly among
note the two groups, allowing the user to see how often
note the results are as extreme as in the actual data.
note
note Do you want to proceed?
yesno k1
exec '2psim\2psim1.mtb' k1
note
echo
end

